2026-01-15T20:20:31.809739+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|The flat is located in a really trendy neighbourhood in London. It's super close to a bunch of hip bars and restaurants, so if you're into that sort of thing, you'll love it! Even if you aren't, I'd still recommend staying at this flat. There's always something going on in this area, and it's really close to transit, entertainment, shopping, great restaurants, etc. The entry way/kitchen/living room area is a bit louder and you can certainly hear noise from your neighbours/down the street. The bedroom itself is extremely quiet so it won't be a problem for those who aren't used to being in a central location. My sister and I ended up sharing a bed instead of making use of the sofa, so I'm not sure how it would be to stay out there. The bed was SO comfortable and, for us, the entire situation was great. The place was perfect and we were sad to leave. The only things we would've liked was to have a full length mirror in the entry way, and more counter space for toiletries/make up/skin care etc. My sister ended up getting all of it so I had to use the kitchen table for the my products. It was okay, but it wasn't ideal. Overall, we had a fantastic time and would recommend it to anyone who was considering this area in London. A solid 4.5*.|5|The flat is located in a really trendy neighbourhood in London. It's super close to a bunch of hip bars and restaurants, so if you're into that sort of thing, you'll love it! Even if you aren't, I'd still recommend staying at this flat. There's always something going on in this area, and it's really close to transit, entertainment, shopping, great restaurants, etc. The entry way/kitchen/living room area is a bit louder and you can certainly hear noise from your neighbours/down the street. The bedroom itself is extremely quiet so it won't be a problem for those who aren't used to being in a central location. My sister and I ended up sharing a bed instead of making use of the sofa, so I'm not sure how it would be to stay out there. The bed was SO comfortable and, for us, the entire situation was great. The place was perfect and we were sad to leave. The only things we would've liked was to have a full length mirror in the entry way, and more counter space for toiletries/make up/skin care etc. My sister ended up getting all of it so I had to use the kitchen table for the my products. It was okay, but it wasn't ideal. Overall, we had a fantastic time and would recommend it to anyone who was considering this area in London. A solid 4.5*.|LATIN|en|The flat is located in a really trendy neighbourhood in London. It's close to a bunch of hip bars and restaurants, so if you're into that sort of thing, you'll love it. The bedroom itself is extremely quiet so it won't be a problem for those who aren't used to being in a central location.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:20:32.656262+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|Ich hatte einen sehr guten Aufenthalt bei Roberto. Ich wurde sofort Nett begrüßt und es wurde sich um mein Gepäck gekümmert. Das Zimmer und das Bad waren sauber und ordentlich. <br/>Die Underground ist auch gut zu fuß zu erreichen, wodurch man die ganze Stadt super erkunden kann. Ich würde wieder bei Roberto Buchen!|1|I had a very good stay with Roberto. I was immediately greeted by Nett and my luggage was taken care of. The room and bathroom were clean and tidy. <br/> The underground is also well reached on foot, which allows you to explore the whole city super. I would go back to Roberto's book!|LATIN|de|I had a very good stay with Roberto. I was immediately greeted by Nett and my luggage was taken care of. The room and bathroom were clean and tidy. I would go back to Roberto's book!|0.0
