2026-01-15T20:20:42.145837+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|Es war sehr schön. Wir durften früher rein da der Flieger schon um 07:00 landete. Wir durften länger bleiben weil der Flieger erst abends ging. <br/>Von der Minute der Buchung waren wir sofort in Kontakt über Telefon / Messenger .  Wie wir zügig und günstig von Heathrow zu ihr gelangen. Also besser geht es nicht. Auch die Begrüßung war lieb und herzlich. <br/>Das Zimmer ist gut. Tisch, Bett , 2 Stühle, Kühlschrank , Wasserkocher und ein Bad direkt daneben. Für alle Fragen war Natalia für uns da. Wir empfehlen Natalia gerne weiter und würden beim nächsten Aufenthalt in London wieder bei ihr einkehren. <br/>Frühstücken kann man ca 300 m weiter im Ambassey Café. Die Bahnstation ist in 40 Sekunden zu erreichen. Ebenso der co-op Shop. <br/>Also alles perfekt.|0|It was very nice. We were allowed in early as the plane landed at 7:00. We were allowed to stay longer because the plane was only leaving at night. <br/>From the minute of booking we were instantly in contact by phone/messenger. How we got to her quickly and cheaply from Heathrow. So it's not much better. The welcome was also kind and cordial. <br/>The room is good. Table, bed, 2 chairs, refrigerator, water cook and bathroom right next door. For all questions Natalia was there for us. We would like to recommend that Natalia continue and would like to stay with her again on the next stay in London. <br/> Breakfast can be at the Café about 300 metres further in the embassy. The train station is in Seq. 40 so the co-op shop <br/> everything is perfect.|LATIN|de|From the minute of booking we were instantly in contact by phone/messenger. How we got to her quickly and cheaply from Heathrow. The welcome was also kind and cordial. For all questions Natalia was there for us.|0.0
