2026-01-15T20:20:52.526392+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|Gemma's place is excellent for a few-day stay - it has everything you need (including towels, shampoo etc.). It was great to feel that someone is living there - many photos, a gramophone player with LPs, a fully equipped kitchen - mainly this is great because some other hosts don't provide everything you might need to cook something. However, the bed is relatively small for two people with only one duvet, which might be a complication for some couples. Also, the apartment is on the ground floor, so you must always keep your blinds closed if you don't like other people looking inside. The last inconvenience was that the neighbour over us had a party at midnight, and since the walls are thin, we heard everything (but I can imagine this was a one-time thing as it happened only once during the week stay).|4|Gemma's place is excellent for a few-day stay - it has everything you need (including towels, shampoo etc.). It was great to feel that someone is living there - many photos, a gramophone player with LPs, a fully equipped kitchen - mainly this is great because some other hosts don't provide everything you might need to cook something. However, the bed is relatively small for two people with only one duvet, which might be a complication for some couples. Also, the apartment is on the ground floor, so you must always keep your blinds closed if you don't like other people looking inside. The last inconvenience was that the neighbour over us had a party at midnight, and since the walls are thin, we heard everything (but I can imagine this was a one-time thing as it happened only once during the week stay).|LATIN|en|Gemma's place is excellent for a few-day stay, but has some minor drawbacks such as a small bed and thin walls.|0.0
