2026-01-15T20:20:57.501687+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|We stayed here with two small children and couldn't have hoped to find anything more ideal. The apartment is well-located, comfortable and was spotless when we arrived. Stephen was a great host, always responding to queries. The apartment is especially good if you are travelling with children, with kids books and toys in the apartment which kept our two entertained throughout our stay. Too bad it was raining most days we were there and we didn't get to enjoy the spacious terrace. We would definitely recommend this place and would definitely come back, even if travelling without kids.|5|We stayed here with two small children and couldn't have hoped to find anything more ideal. The apartment is well-located, comfortable and was spotless when we arrived. Stephen was a great host, always responding to queries. The apartment is especially good if you are travelling with children, with kids books and toys in the apartment which kept our two entertained throughout our stay. Too bad it was raining most days we were there and we didn't get to enjoy the spacious terrace. We would definitely recommend this place and would definitely come back, even if travelling without kids.|LATIN|en|Stephen was a great host, always responding to queries. The apartment is especially good if you are travelling with children. Too bad it was raining most days we were there.|0.0
