d 3 nights as everything else in the area was booked  but in many years of being on Air Bnb this was one of the most uncomfortable, most inhospitable stays I have had to date. The mattress in this room is way below par, and I'm amazed it hasn't been changed or considered as poor.|LATIN|en|A really uncomfortable poor quality bed, poor communication, and poor hospitality. Code for key was not provided and called several times to ask her for it, and no reply.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:21:00.352150+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|Kamilla’s place is close to the center, location is perfect. Checkin is flexible with codes which is amazing. She provided clear instructions on how to get to her place. You can take metro to Warren Street or Euston Station, same walking distance. The only downside is that room is extremly small, for two people it’s too tight honestly. Also, when we arrived, because it’s a shared bathroom, toilet was in a messy state because of the other guests. They also left hair everywhere etc. throughout their stay. I would suggest adding desinfectant because it’s a shared bathroom. I escalated the bathroom situation to Kamilla and also asked her whether she had power converter for EU, however I haven’t received any response from the check in day when I sent this message which is disappointing. There is no power converter, so bring yours. Also, there was a lot of noise in the early mornings around 7 (possibly cleaning lady doing washing etc.), which woke us up.<br/>All in all, the stay was 6/10.|5|Kamilla’s place is close to the center, location is perfect. Checkin is flexible with codes which is amazing. She provided clear instructions on how to get to her place. You can take metro to Warren Street or Euston Station, same walking distance. The only downside is that room is extremly small, for two people it’s too tight honestly. Also, when we arrived, because it’s a shared bathroom, toilet was in a messy state because of the other guests. They also left hair everywhere etc. throughout their stay. I would suggest adding desinfectant because it’s a shared bathroom. I escalated the bathroom situation to Kamilla and also asked her whether she had power converter for EU, however I haven’t received any response from the check in day when I sent this message which is disappointing. There is no power converter, so bring yours. Also, there was a lot of noise in the early mornings around 7 (possibly cleaning lady doing washing etc.), which woke us up.<br/>All in all, the stay was 6/10.|LATIN|en|Guest had a 6/10 stay at Kamilla's place due to small room size, messy shared bathroom, and lack of communication from the host.|0.0
