2026-01-15T20:21:31.960780+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|Merci, cet appartement est fidèle à la description. <br/>Une station d’overground est à 10 minutes à pied, et il y a beaucoup de magasins autour qui facilitent le quotidien. L’appartement est bien équipé et suffisamment grand pour un couple et un enfant. <br/>Un petit bémol cependant : mon conjoint est allergique à la poussière et a fait une grosse crise pendant notre séjour. L’appartement est plutôt propre, mais la moquette doit retenir de la poussière.|4|Thank you, this apartment is true to the description. <br/>A overground station is a 10-minute walk away, and there are many shops around that make everyday life easier. The apartment is well equipped and big enough for a couple and a child. <br/>A small bemool however: my husband is allergic to dust and had a big seizure during our stay. The apartment is quite clean, but the carpet should be dust-free.|LATIN|fr|The apartment is well-equipped and well-located, but the carpet needs to be dust-free due to allergy issues.|0.0
