2026-01-15T20:21:33.313277+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|We had a wonderful stay at this great apartment. The communication and check in instructions were very clear, the key is collected from a security box at a local off licence, an 8 minute walk away, luckily we were driving so this was very easy for us to collect before heading to the property.<br/>The ‘permit parking’ on the street ends around 6pm on Fridays, so we parked for free on the main road outside for the weekend - this is a great bonus especially for London.<br/>The apartment was very spacious and clean. 2 good sized bedrooms, newly decorated bathroom and large kitchen/living area. The hosts left a bowl of welcome snacks and tea which was a lovely touch, there was no milk but we picked some up from the shop when collecting the key.<br/>The kitchen is fully equipped and has everything you need including a coffee machine.<br/>This didn’t feel like a typical serviced apart and felt more like a home. We will definitely stay again|5|We had a wonderful stay at this great apartment. The communication and check in instructions were very clear, the key is collected from a security box at a local off licence, an 8 minute walk away, luckily we were driving so this was very easy for us to collect before heading to the property.<br/>The ‘permit parking’ on the street ends around 6pm on Fridays, so we parked for free on the main road outside for the weekend - this is a great bonus especially for London.<br/>The apartment was very spacious and clean. 2 good sized bedrooms, newly decorated bathroom and large kitchen/living area. The hosts left a bowl of welcome snacks and tea which was a lovely touch, there was no milk but we picked some up from the shop when collecting the key.<br/>The kitchen is fully equipped and has everything you need including a coffee machine.<br/>This didn’t feel like a typical serviced apart and felt more like a home. We will definitely stay again|LATIN|en|We had a wonderful stay at this great apartment. The key is collected from a security box at a local off licence, an 8 minute walk away. The ‘permit parking’ on the street ends around 6pm on Fridays.|0.0
