2026-01-15T20:21:34.822923+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|**first time to London and it was a disaster, I dun have British fake kindness so here are some points to note. good luck everyone :))<br/>-heating is timed (8-10am & 7-11pm)<br/>-wifi you will be using is different from which showing on bnb <br/>-host bang on my door complained I used the air dryer for too long <br/>(as an asian with long thick hair, i bet host couldn’t imagine how long it would take to dry my hair)<br/>**hidden house rules (will be reminded upon your arrival)<br/>-place water faucet handle right in the middle after used (not too left, not too right, perfect)<br/>-leave your room door slightly open when you are out (host entered my room to turn wifi off THX) <br/>-10 mins shower is encouraged<br/>**good points<br/>-gorgeous plants<br/>-host is responsive<br/>-room is well equipped and facilities are in good condition<br/>lastly, as a bnb host, I had bad experience during hosting too but that wont change my way of being considerate and sincere to any stranger aka guest(true advice from a girl under 30, hope u enjoy)|5|**first time to London and it was a disaster, I dun have British fake kindness so here are some points to note. good luck everyone :))<br/>-heating is timed (8-10am & 7-11pm)<br/>-wifi you will be using is different from which showing on bnb <br/>-host bang on my door complained I used the air dryer for too long <br/>(as an asian with long thick hair, i bet host couldn’t imagine how long it would take to dry my hair)<br/>**hidden house rules (will be reminded upon your arrival)<br/>-place water faucet handle right in the middle after used (not too left, not too right, perfect)<br/>-leave your room door slightly open when you are out (host entered my room to turn wifi off THX) <br/>-10 mins shower is encouraged<br/>**good points<br/>-gorgeous plants<br/>-host is responsive<br/>-room is well equipped and facilities are in good condition<br/>lastly, as a bnb host, I had bad experience during hosting too but that wont change my way of being considerate and sincere to any stranger aka guest(true advice from a girl under 30, hope u enjoy)|LATIN|en|**first time to London and it was a disaster, I dun have British fake kindness so here are some points to note.-heating is timed (8-10am & 7-11pm)-wifi you will be using is different from which showing on bnb.-leave your room door slightly open when you are out.-10 mins shower is encouraged.|0.0
