2026-01-15T20:21:36.100210+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|We couldn’t have had a better stay. The location was perfect. Check in was easy. Alexandre was super responsive with any questions prior to arriving and then upon arrival he was always prompt with answering any questions we had. The flat was a large size and very clean. We loved the unit and the location. It’s right next to two tube stations and backs to a park. It’s easy to walk everywhere and is enough off the beaten path that it feels like you’re in a quiet neighborhood. Definitely recommend and would stay here again.|5|We couldn’t have had a better stay. The location was perfect. Check in was easy. Alexandre was super responsive with any questions prior to arriving and then upon arrival he was always prompt with answering any questions we had. The flat was a large size and very clean. We loved the unit and the location. It’s right next to two tube stations and backs to a park. It’s easy to walk everywhere and is enough off the beaten path that it feels like you’re in a quiet neighborhood. Definitely recommend and would stay here again.|LATIN|en|We couldn't have had a better stay. The location was perfect. Check in was easy. Alexandre was super responsive with any questions prior to arriving.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:21:36.484233+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|We really enjoyed our stay at James’s place. The location was unbeatable and the property itself was beautiful. The host was incredibly responsive which was helpful since we visited during a time when there was a heatwave and needed to ensure there were fans (which there were). <br/>Pro’s: location, beautiful property, responsive and kind host. Well worth the price tag!<br/>Con’s: we have kids with allergies to dust and cats/dogs. They normally do best in places without carpets.|5|We really enjoyed our stay at James’s place. The location was unbeatable and the property itself was beautiful. The host was incredibly responsive which was helpful since we visited during a time when there was a heatwave and needed to ensure there were fans (which there were). <br/>Pro’s: location, beautiful property, responsive and kind host. Well worth the price tag!<br/>Con’s: we have kids with allergies to dust and cats/dogs. They normally do best in places without carpets.|LATIN|en|Guest enjoyed their stay at James's place due to its unbeatable location, beautiful property, and responsive host, but noted some drawbacks.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:21:36.947358+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|We were a family of 6. The space was adequate for us. The half bath was convenient to have with multiple people. We really appreciated the tower fans in the bedrooms and the windows opening as there is no A/C. The unit is on the top floor so that was nice to have no one above and the unit and building was very quiet. The first impression of the building was not great (odor and location) but the unit was nice. The washer/dryer was also very nice to have!  The location was not ideal - long walk to any tube station and bringing luggage to and from. The bus stop was very close so we used that multiple times. Overall this was a decent spot to come back to but if we were looking again I would try and find something closer to a tube station or the tourist attractions in zone 1.|5|We were a family of 6. The space was adequate for us. The half bath was convenient to have with multiple people. We really appreciated the tower fans in the bedrooms and the windows opening as there is no A/C. The unit is on the top floor so that was nice to have no one above and the unit and building was very quiet. The first impression of the building was not great (odor and location) but the unit was nice. The washer/dryer was also very nice to have!  The location was not ideal - long walk to any tube station and bringing luggage to and from. The bus stop was very close so we used that multiple times. Overall this was a decent spot to come back to but if we were looking again I would try and find something closer to a tube station or the tourist attractions in zone 1.|LATIN|en|We were a family of 6. The space was adequate for us. The half bath was convenient to have with multiple people. The location was not ideal - long walk to any tube station and bringing luggage to and from.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:21:37.305406+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|Great location, right in the middle of Shoreditch. Easily walkable, with great restaurants and bars close by. The apartment was clean and spacious. It was def hot and I would be wary staying there when it’s hot outside. We also found there were so many rules and extra charges for things we didn’t feel that comfortable relaxing in the home and didn’t spend much time there. The TV was also not working. There also wasn’t enough time between the change over from us and the last guest so there was a ton of wet laundry in our closet we ended up having to deal with.|5|Great location, right in the middle of Shoreditch. Easily walkable, with great restaurants and bars close by. The apartment was clean and spacious. It was def hot and I would be wary staying there when it’s hot outside. We also found there were so many rules and extra charges for things we didn’t feel that comfortable relaxing in the home and didn’t spend much time there. The TV was also not working. There also wasn’t enough time between the change over from us and the last guest so there was a ton of wet laundry in our closet we ended up having to deal with.|LATIN|en|Great location, clean and spacious apartment, but some issues with rules and extra charges and not working TV.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:21:37.666206+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|Another great stay. Nadia has a lovely house in a great location. We loved the cafes on Roman Rd, and  walking the canals. Santander bikes are close by, we cycled back from Greenwich via the tunnel. There is a lovely cycle route largely along the canal. Ombra in Bethnal Green is great for Italian food. Highly recommend staying at Nadia’s.|5|Another great stay. Nadia has a lovely house in a great location. We loved the cafes on Roman Rd, and  walking the canals. Santander bikes are close by, we cycled back from Greenwich via the tunnel. There is a lovely cycle route largely along the canal. Ombra in Bethnal Green is great for Italian food. Highly recommend staying at Nadia’s.|LATIN|en|Guest had a great stay at Nadia's house, praising its location, amenities, and host's hospitality.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:21:38.022485+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|Joanna is such a brilliant host who was quick to respond and helpful in every way which made our stay so relaxing and enjoyable.<br/>Her place is spotless with nice taste of interior design. It is also spacious for four of us and so close to the tube stn. <br/>Would definitely come back again for this lovely place.|5|Joanna is such a brilliant host who was quick to respond and helpful in every way which made our stay so relaxing and enjoyable.<br/>Her place is spotless with nice taste of interior design. It is also spacious for four of us and so close to the tube stn. <br/>Would definitely come back again for this lovely place.|LATIN|en|Joanna is a brilliant host who made our stay relaxing and enjoyable with her spotless and spacious place.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:21:39.435666+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|Superbe séjour que nous avons passé au sein du logement proposé par Isabel ! Nous avons été chaleureusement accueilli par Lou, une amie d'Isabel qui a été très flexible sur notre horaire d'arrivée et qui nous a présenté le logement, en restant disponible au long du voyage.<br/>L'emplacement est idéal pour accéder au centre de Londres (bus, métro) à une vingtaine de minutes à pied de la gare de King's Cross, et proche de plusieurs restaurants et commerces, ce qui est un avantage non négligeable. Nous avons eu la chance de ne pas avoir trop de bruit dans le quartier, malgré la disponibilité de bouchons d'oreille dans le logement (probablement dû au fait d'avoir séjourné en semaine). Nous avons eu cependant des difficultés à dormir à cause d'un matelas un peu dur. De plus, l'escalier permettant d'accéder au logement est un peu étroit, ce qui sera compliqué avec beaucoup d'affaires ou pour des personnes à mobilité réduite.<br/>Merci pour le séjour au sein de cet appartement cosy et chaleureux.|4|We were warmly welcomed by Lou, a friend of Isabel's who was very flexible with our arrival time and introduced us to the accommodation, remaining available throughout the trip.<br/>The location is ideal for access to central London (bus, subway) about a twenty-minute walk from King's Cross station, and close to several restaurants and shops, which is a significant advantage. We were lucky not to have too much noise in the neighbourhood, despite the availability of earplugs in the accommodation (probably due to the fact of staying close during the week). However, we had difficulty sleeping on a mattress, which makes it much easier to get to the apartment, and with a little moisture and/or lack of business, we have a lot of room to stay in.|LATIN|fr|The location is ideal for access to central London (bus, subway) about a twenty-minute walk from King's Cross station. We were lucky not to have too much noise in the neighbourhood, despite the availability of earplugs.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:21:40.772161+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|Wir wollten 4 Tage bleiben, jedoch haben wir kurz nach em Einchecken storniert und haben ein Hotel gebucht. Ich möchte nicht zu negativ bewerten, da die Beschreibung und die Fotos schon der Realität entsprechen. Jedoch haben wir uns einfach nicht wohl gefühlt. Es war sehr hellhörig, man alles in der Umgebung und jedes Wort der Mitbewohner im Haus gehört. Die Bettwäsche war definitiv nicht gewechselt, da sie gerochen hat und Haare drauf waren und die Handtücher waren fleckig. Und das relativ weit außerhalb. Wir haben für uns beschlossen in London definitiv künftig auf ein Hotel zu setzen, da wir bei dem nocarz inkl. aller Gebühren fast auf die gleiche Summe kamen wie bei dem spontan gebuchten Hotel MIT Frühstück sogar und deutlich zentraler.|0|We were going to stay for four days, but we cancelled shortly after check-in and booked a hotel. I don't want to be negative, because the description and the photos are already in the real world. However, we just didn't feel comfortable. It was very bright, you could hear everything in the neighborhood and every word from the roommates. The bedding was definitely not changed, because it smelled and the hair was on it and the towels were stained. And that was relatively far out of the question. We decided to go to a hotel in London for sure in the future, because we came up with almost the same amount as the hotel booked at the nocarz etc.|LATIN|de|We were going to stay for four days, but we cancelled shortly after check-in and booked a hotel. It was very bright, you could hear everything in the neighborhood and every word from the roommates. The bedding was definitely not changed, because it smelled and the hair was on it.|0.0
