2026-01-15T20:21:42.023842+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|I am so glad I found Ariel's room in Hendon, just a few steps away from Hendon Central and another few steps from the institute where I took my course. In the mornings I could enjoy some runs in the park nearby too. Ariel was such a thoughtful and considerate host even before the stay via messages to inform me and make we feel welcome. He also prepared a little booklet with useful information which I found in my room. In the flat he labeled the storages in the hall and kitchen so that the guests could easily find what they need. Thank you Ariel, I will be back when continuing my course next term.|5|I am so glad I found Ariel's room in Hendon, just a few steps away from Hendon Central and another few steps from the institute where I took my course. In the mornings I could enjoy some runs in the park nearby too. Ariel was such a thoughtful and considerate host even before the stay via messages to inform me and make we feel welcome. He also prepared a little booklet with useful information which I found in my room. In the flat he labeled the storages in the hall and kitchen so that the guests could easily find what they need. Thank you Ariel, I will be back when continuing my course next term.|LATIN|en|I am so glad I found Ariel's room in Hendon, just a few steps away from Hendon Central and another few steps from the institute where I took my course. Ariel was such a thoughtful and considerate host even before the stay via messages to inform me and make we feel welcome.|0.0
