roken so that it wouldn’t stay up. We won’t be back.|LATIN|en|Julia was very kind and flexible as a host. Location is close to paddington so getting there from the airport (and back) was easy. The immediate surroundings aren’t very picturesque but the convenience to Paddington station was worth it.|0.0
