2026-01-15T20:22:14.255501+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|This accommodation was perfect for us. We had events in Wembley and Excel and both were really easy to get to with the tube station so nearby (but not noisy). We even ventured by bus to the RAF Museum. Spotless, attractive and a very pleasant place to sit and chill one day too. We didn't use the cornershop across from the tube station, but it was good to know it was there. The only challenge during this stay was the immersion heater in the eaves right by the bedroom. This seems like it gets activated whenever anybody in the complex of flats runs a hot tap and so randomly starts-stopd during the night for late night showers and whatever else. You can hear what i assume is the fan of the neighbouring flat bathroom too. Thankfully, I'd seen a previous comment in a review and made sure to pack earplugs and I slept much better after the first night. Syed's instructions were really clear and timed very well. And any additional queries were answered very promptly. :)|5|This accommodation was perfect for us. We had events in Wembley and Excel and both were really easy to get to with the tube station so nearby (but not noisy). We even ventured by bus to the RAF Museum. Spotless, attractive and a very pleasant place to sit and chill one day too. We didn't use the cornershop across from the tube station, but it was good to know it was there. The only challenge during this stay was the immersion heater in the eaves right by the bedroom. This seems like it gets activated whenever anybody in the complex of flats runs a hot tap and so randomly starts-stopd during the night for late night showers and whatever else. You can hear what i assume is the fan of the neighbouring flat bathroom too. Thankfully, I'd seen a previous comment in a review and made sure to pack earplugs and I slept much better after the first night. Syed's instructions were really clear and timed very well. And any additional queries were answered very promptly. :)|LATIN|en|Perfect accommodation for events in Wembley and Excel with easy access to tube station, but some noise from the immersion heater.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:22:15.416054+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|Der Aufenthalt in dem Apartment war super! Die Mitbewohner waren nett, die Verständigung zwischen Marcelo und uns war auch sehr gut. Schnelle Antworten und immer sehr hilfsbereit bei fragen. Das Apartment ist direkt an einer U-Bahn Station und ein Einkaufsladen direkt nebenan, was sehr viele Vorteile verschaffte. Die Badezimmer waren auch relativ sauber (man muss dabei bedenken, dass dort noch mehrere Leute leben, so kann man nicht immer von blitzblank ausgehen) aber alles komplett im Rahmen. Alles was man braucht ist zur Verfügung gestellt. Shampoo, Duschgel, Spülung und auch Handtücher und ein Fön.<br/>Gerne wieder ! ☺️|0|The apartment was great! The roommates were nice, the understanding between Marcelo and us was very good too. Quick answers and always very helpful when asking questions. The apartment is right next to a subway station and a shopping mall, which provided many advantages. The bathrooms were also relatively clean (you have to keep in mind that there are still more people living there, so you can't always assume that you're lightning blind) but everything is completely in the frame. Everything you need is provided. Shampoo, shower, rinse and also hand towels and a towel.<br/>Again! ☺️|LATIN|de|The apartment was great! The roommates were nice, the understanding between Marcelo and us was very good too. The apartment is right next to a subway station and a shopping mall, which provided many advantages.|0.0
