2026-01-15T20:22:18.300183+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|Outstanding Air B&B. Room was perfectly clean and beds were delightfully comfy. Exceptionally good value for money considering the quality of the room and how easy it is to get to get into Central London. Hosts were easily contacted and very friendly. When they called to tell us that the room we had originally booked was unavailable due to cleaning, they provided another one of their rooms with no hassle. They even allowed us to use the parking space after our stay was over just for the day, which was a load off of our mind as we still had things we wanted to do in London. Shower was high quality with good water pressure, and room even had a washer/dryer. Very spacious so great for long and short stay, on a very quiet street. For the price offered, this is the closest you will get to a perfect Air B&B.|5|Outstanding Air B&B. Room was perfectly clean and beds were delightfully comfy. Exceptionally good value for money considering the quality of the room and how easy it is to get to get into Central London. Hosts were easily contacted and very friendly. When they called to tell us that the room we had originally booked was unavailable due to cleaning, they provided another one of their rooms with no hassle. They even allowed us to use the parking space after our stay was over just for the day, which was a load off of our mind as we still had things we wanted to do in London. Shower was high quality with good water pressure, and room even had a washer/dryer. Very spacious so great for long and short stay, on a very quiet street. For the price offered, this is the closest you will get to a perfect Air B&B.|LATIN|en|Guest found the room to be outstanding value for money, with friendly hosts and a clean and comfortable room.|0.0
