2026-01-15T20:22:23.179897+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|My husband and I and our 18 month old daughter had a comfortable stay in Emma’s flat. The flat is well located just off the high street, but on a nice quiet road. The flat is very homely, with comfortable furniture and nice touches like a basket full of mini cosmetics in the bathroom for guests to use. It was also great for our daughter who slept in the cot in the nursery - she really enjoyed reading the children’s books! The only slight downsides were it felt a little cluttered in the kitchen area - there wasn’t much space to put our food, and there isn’t access to a freezer, which wasn’t a problem for us, but might bother some people. Also Emma uses a third party to manage the flat, and I found them slow to respond to messages sent on nocarz. If you need a quick response I found out the best thing to do is call them on the mobile number they send you in the check in instructions. Overall, a comfortable stay in a great location!|5|My husband and I and our 18 month old daughter had a comfortable stay in Emma’s flat. The flat is well located just off the high street, but on a nice quiet road. The flat is very homely, with comfortable furniture and nice touches like a basket full of mini cosmetics in the bathroom for guests to use. It was also great for our daughter who slept in the cot in the nursery - she really enjoyed reading the children’s books! The only slight downsides were it felt a little cluttered in the kitchen area - there wasn’t much space to put our food, and there isn’t access to a freezer, which wasn’t a problem for us, but might bother some people. Also Emma uses a third party to manage the flat, and I found them slow to respond to messages sent on nocarz. If you need a quick response I found out the best thing to do is call them on the mobile number they send you in the check in instructions. Overall, a comfortable stay in a great location!|LATIN|en|The flat is well located just off the high street, but on a nice quiet road. The flat is very homely, with comfortable furniture and nice touches like a basket full of mini cosmetics in the bathroom for guests to use. It was also great for our daughter who slept in the cot in the nursery - she really enjoyed reading the children’s books!|0.0
