2026-01-15T20:22:36.681956+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|We really enjoyed our 11 night stay in this lovely London home. Our group was 2 seniors, 2 adults, and 2 teens. The 4 bedrooms worked perfectly for us and we really felt at home. We also enjoyed the outdoor space each day and were thankful to have a kitchen and washer/dryer.<br/>A couple considerations - there are 3 flights of stairs that will need to be navigated to reach the bedrooms and kitchens. The listing states "central air conditioning" but only the bedrooms are air conditioned. In mild weather it would not be a concern, but it was quite hot weather while we were there. <br/>One of the best features of this home is the location. We walked to Kings Cross/St Pancras every day (5-7 minutes) and could go anywhere by train, bus or Underground from there. There was a grocery store just steps away, and many pubs and restaurants nearby. Despite the central location, the side street where we stayed was remarkably quiet and peaceful. It was a great home base for our London adventure, thanks!|5|We really enjoyed our 11 night stay in this lovely London home. Our group was 2 seniors, 2 adults, and 2 teens. The 4 bedrooms worked perfectly for us and we really felt at home. We also enjoyed the outdoor space each day and were thankful to have a kitchen and washer/dryer.<br/>A couple considerations - there are 3 flights of stairs that will need to be navigated to reach the bedrooms and kitchens. The listing states "central air conditioning" but only the bedrooms are air conditioned. In mild weather it would not be a concern, but it was quite hot weather while we were there. <br/>One of the best features of this home is the location. We walked to Kings Cross/St Pancras every day (5-7 minutes) and could go anywhere by train, bus or Underground from there. There was a grocery store just steps away, and many pubs and restaurants nearby. Despite the central location, the side street where we stayed was remarkably quiet and peaceful. It was a great home base for our London adventure, thanks!|LATIN|en|Lovely London home with 4 bedrooms, outdoor space, and central location, but some minor issues with stairs and central air conditioning.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:22:37.071617+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|Yossi's Cabin got a full five stars from me on everything and they were all well deserved. It's a delightful, comfortable and very well-equipped cabin at the end of a pretty garden. Check-in was a breeze and while staying in the Cabin is very private, Yossi always seemed to be available if there were any questions or if anything was needed, which of course it wasn't. The location is good too for getting into central London as well as for walks into Richmond Park or along the river in Kingston and the excellent fish restaurant at the end of the road is a must-visit. Thank you Yossi, your Cabin is high on my favourite's list.  |5|Yossi's Cabin got a full five stars from me on everything and they were all well deserved. It's a delightful, comfortable and very well-equipped cabin at the end of a pretty garden. Check-in was a breeze and while staying in the Cabin is very private, Yossi always seemed to be available if there were any questions or if anything was needed, which of course it wasn't. The location is good too for getting into central London as well as for walks into Richmond Park or along the river in Kingston and the excellent fish restaurant at the end of the road is a must-visit. Thank you Yossi, your Cabin is high on my favourite's list.  |LATIN|en|Yossi's Cabin is a delightful, comfortable, and well-equipped cabin in a great location with excellent communication from the host.|0.0
