l the issues above are resolved.|LATIN|en|Despite good communication through nocarz from the host, the accommodation is completely uninhabitable. Had to wait 15 minutes in the pouring rain for someone to turn up, check in and show me round the flat. Windows were disgusting and look like they've never been cleaned.|0.0
