2026-01-15T20:22:38.391525+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|This is a great flat in a very well connected area. The flat itself is very bright and airy, with large window that can let in the natural light. It is spacious, we were a family of 5 (2 adults and 3 young children) and found that it was very suitable for our needs. The kitchen is modern and very well equipped and the bathroom was likewise. We stayed at the flat for 3 weeks and found it to be very comfortable. It is located in an area which has lots of restaurants etc in the very near vicinity, otherwise the closest tube stop is a 5 minute walk away. You're not in the very centre of London but you're very close and the area strikes a good balance. It was never an issue to get around London from the flat, and we had 2 young boys in buggys. The host was also very responsive. I would definitely stay here again and highly recommend.|5|This is a great flat in a very well connected area. The flat itself is very bright and airy, with large window that can let in the natural light. It is spacious, we were a family of 5 (2 adults and 3 young children) and found that it was very suitable for our needs. The kitchen is modern and very well equipped and the bathroom was likewise. We stayed at the flat for 3 weeks and found it to be very comfortable. It is located in an area which has lots of restaurants etc in the very near vicinity, otherwise the closest tube stop is a 5 minute walk away. You're not in the very centre of London but you're very close and the area strikes a good balance. It was never an issue to get around London from the flat, and we had 2 young boys in buggys. The host was also very responsive. I would definitely stay here again and highly recommend.|LATIN|en|Great flat in a well-connected area, bright and airy, suitable for a family of 5, with modern amenities and responsive host.|0.0
