2026-01-15T20:23:04.422845+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|I would highly recommend these accommodations for the excellent location, quiet surroundings, and fair amenities. This is about a 3 minute walk to the Sloane Square tube station, which connects to all the main attractions in London. As first time visitors to London, we were able to visit all the main tourist attractions, all within a 10-25 minute tube ride. My family and I were impressed with how quiet the neighborhood was- it was completely quiet at night and we were awoken by birds chirping in the gardens in the morning, which was nice. It seems to be a very safe area as well. It is close to Wulf and Lamb, which is a vegan restaurant we enjoyed visiting several times. I also appreciated the French press for morning coffee. The second (smaller) bedroom near the kitchen/living room does not have a door (which we were told ahead of time and didn't bother us), but is good to know as I imagine this could be an issue for some groups. The apartment was also clean and the check in was easy. I would be happy to stay here again!|5|I would highly recommend these accommodations for the excellent location, quiet surroundings, and fair amenities. This is about a 3 minute walk to the Sloane Square tube station, which connects to all the main attractions in London. As first time visitors to London, we were able to visit all the main tourist attractions, all within a 10-25 minute tube ride. My family and I were impressed with how quiet the neighborhood was- it was completely quiet at night and we were awoken by birds chirping in the gardens in the morning, which was nice. It seems to be a very safe area as well. It is close to Wulf and Lamb, which is a vegan restaurant we enjoyed visiting several times. I also appreciated the French press for morning coffee. The second (smaller) bedroom near the kitchen/living room does not have a door (which we were told ahead of time and didn't bother us), but is good to know as I imagine this could be an issue for some groups. The apartment was also clean and the check in was easy. I would be happy to stay here again!|LATIN|en|This is about a 3 minute walk to the Sloane Square tube station, which connects to all the main attractions in London. It is close to Wulf and Lamb, which is a vegan restaurant we enjoyed visiting several times. I also appreciated the French press for morning coffee.|0.0
