nything. I told him that was a small problem, a ceiling leak when I used the bathtub, but it wasn't too big of a deal for me. He promptly send a plumber that fixed the issue on the following day.<br/>Overall an excellent experience, highly recommend it!|LATIN|en|Guest had an excellent experience at Tom's cottage, which was clean, comfortable, and conveniently located near Limehouse station and amenities.|0.0
