2026-01-15T20:23:45.982589+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|The location is good for travellers visiting London. Overground station is 5 mins walk and 1 stop to Victoria station. Although visitors have to pay 2.50 pounds for 1 stop, there is a cap of 7 pounds a day so it is not too expensive to get around London by train. There is a Tesco nearby for groceries shopping. One thing to note, if visitors are coming with heavy luggages, both nearby train stations do not have elevator so I would suggest taking bus 44 if you are coming from Victoria station. There is an elevator in the apartment building so that is fine. Overall, I would say that the apartment is good for a short term stay in London. We stayed 5 days and 4 nights in this apartment and basic necessities were provided. Please also follow the host instructions closely when checking in.|4|The location is good for travellers visiting London. Overground station is 5 mins walk and 1 stop to Victoria station. Although visitors have to pay 2.50 pounds for 1 stop, there is a cap of 7 pounds a day so it is not too expensive to get around London by train. There is a Tesco nearby for groceries shopping. One thing to note, if visitors are coming with heavy luggages, both nearby train stations do not have elevator so I would suggest taking bus 44 if you are coming from Victoria station. There is an elevator in the apartment building so that is fine. Overall, I would say that the apartment is good for a short term stay in London. We stayed 5 days and 4 nights in this apartment and basic necessities were provided. Please also follow the host instructions closely when checking in.|LATIN|en|The location is good for travellers visiting London. Overground station is 5 mins walk and 1 stop to Victoria station. There is a Tesco nearby for groceries shopping.|0.0
