2026-01-15T20:23:59.931618+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|Great nocarz in the heart of Angel!   Celine is a very responsive and welcoming host.  Directions and instructions were all clear and concise.  The flat is so bright and cheery!  Very clean with a spacious bedroom and bathroom.  Living area is a bit on the small side with a small sofa and eating area, but very welcoming.   Bed is small for 2 adults, but comfortable.  We arrived and there were no towels, however Celine responded immediately and delivered towels within 2 hours for us.  It was hot during our stay but a great cross breeze can be achieved in the flat, as well as a portable fan.  Would highly recommend this area and flat for visitors to London.|5|Great nocarz in the heart of Angel!   Celine is a very responsive and welcoming host.  Directions and instructions were all clear and concise.  The flat is so bright and cheery!  Very clean with a spacious bedroom and bathroom.  Living area is a bit on the small side with a small sofa and eating area, but very welcoming.   Bed is small for 2 adults, but comfortable.  We arrived and there were no towels, however Celine responded immediately and delivered towels within 2 hours for us.  It was hot during our stay but a great cross breeze can be achieved in the flat, as well as a portable fan.  Would highly recommend this area and flat for visitors to London.|LATIN|en|Celine is a very responsive and welcoming host. The flat is so bright and cheery! Very clean with a spacious bedroom and bathroom. Bed is small for 2 adults, but comfortable.|0.0
