2026-01-15T20:24:01.515399+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|Kommunikation: hervorragend / phantastisch.<br/>Lage: sehr zentral/gut gelegen, wenn auch die Gegend selber nicht unbedingt schön ist, eher ein bisschen heruntergekommen wirkt.<br/>Check-in: verlief absolut problemlos, obwohl wir erst ganz spät einchecken konnten.<br/>Die Sauberkeit entsprach leider nicht ganz unseren Vorstellungen / Ansprüchen: <br/>grundsätzlich staubig, insbesondere auch in den Schränken, Geschirr teilweise dreckig, insbesondere auch Pfannen, Fenster sahen aus, also ob sie noch nie gereinigt waren, die Rollos bei den Fenstern waren klebrig unappetitlich, usw. <br/>Hinzu kam, dass es im Lift immer wieder fürchterlich stinkte.|0|Communication: excellent / fantastic.<br/>Location: very central/well located, although the area itself is not necessarily beautiful, seems to have fallen down a bit.<br/>Check-in: went absolutely smoothly, although we could check in very late.<br/>Cleanliness unfortunately did not quite meet our expectations: <br/>basically dusty, especially in the cabinets, dishes partly dirty, especially pans, windows looked dirty, so whether they had never been cleaned, the rolos at the windows were sticky unappetite, etc. <br/>The elevator always stinks for the smell.|LATIN|de|Excellent communication and location, but cleanliness was not as expected and elevator stinks for no reason.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:24:02.042442+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|As I had to be in London for 6 weeks, for both work and vacation, Nick’s 1 BR apartment at Clapham Junction was cosy and comfortable, making my 42 days stay a home away from home. <br/>The location is well connected to the City as well as central London by bus, tube and rail. The view from the apartment especially for sunset are just amazing especially after a long day at work.<br/>Good selection of restaurants, cafes and pubs all around the area within 10-15mins walk, depending on which direction one takes. Location, accessibility and amenities are all 5 out of 5.<br/>However, its most unfortunate that during the last two weeks of my stay, the lift leading to the apartment on level 5 broke down. After more than two weeks, the lift was still not repaired which made the climb to the apartment a real chore. Nick was not only apologetic but was kind enough to provide help with my luggages on the day of my checkout.<br/>As the saying goes, there is no perfect apartment, because if there is one, please don’t go, cos we will spoil it! Like a home, things do get spoiled… and I just hope it gets repaired soon.<br/>I know I will definitely be back at the apartment should I head back to London for work or play. Thanks again Nick!|5|As I had to be in London for 6 weeks, for both work and vacation, Nick’s 1 BR apartment at Clapham Junction was cosy and comfortable, making my 42 days stay a home away from home. <br/>The location is well connected to the City as well as central London by bus, tube and rail. The view from the apartment especially for sunset are just amazing especially after a long day at work.<br/>Good selection of restaurants, cafes and pubs all around the area within 10-15mins walk, depending on which direction one takes. Location, accessibility and amenities are all 5 out of 5.<br/>However, its most unfortunate that during the last two weeks of my stay, the lift leading to the apartment on level 5 broke down. After more than two weeks, the lift was still not repaired which made the climb to the apartment a real chore. Nick was not only apologetic but was kind enough to provide help with my luggages on the day of my checkout.<br/>As the saying goes, there is no perfect apartment, because if there is one, please don’t go, cos we will spoil it! Like a home, things do get spoiled… and I just hope it gets repaired soon.<br/>I know I will definitely be back at the apartment should I head back to London for work or play. Thanks again Nick!|LATIN|en|Nick’s 1 BR apartment at Clapham Junction was cosy and comfortable, making my 42 days stay a home away from home. Location, accessibility and amenities are all 5 out of 5. The view from the apartment especially for sunset are just amazing.|0.0
