2026-01-15T20:24:17.424294+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|This place is all about location. And the host is communicative and responsive. Very close to parks and all public transport and still quiet, minus the (unpredictable) neighbor next door or upstairs. The “hotel quality” of linens etc is definitely not 5 star hotel: everything is squeaky clean but needs maintenance (moldy spots, tile missing, broken closet door). The toiletries and linen would be similar to a 2 star hotel. Very important: if folks have any mobility difficulties they should avoid this place as stairs are really narrow. I’m 1,58 m / 5,2 feet and a size small, and I found the bathroom incredibly small but manageable. My travel companion is 2m/ 6,3ft and one night they hit their  head just going to the toilet at night, waking up to a big and bloody scratch that had to be taken care of. So I’d say anyone over 6ft should also avoid the place for safety. It’s a lovely and clean place to stay overnight and sleep well to then cook eggs in the morning.|5|This place is all about location. And the host is communicative and responsive. Very close to parks and all public transport and still quiet, minus the (unpredictable) neighbor next door or upstairs. The “hotel quality” of linens etc is definitely not 5 star hotel: everything is squeaky clean but needs maintenance (moldy spots, tile missing, broken closet door). The toiletries and linen would be similar to a 2 star hotel. Very important: if folks have any mobility difficulties they should avoid this place as stairs are really narrow. I’m 1,58 m / 5,2 feet and a size small, and I found the bathroom incredibly small but manageable. My travel companion is 2m/ 6,3ft and one night they hit their  head just going to the toilet at night, waking up to a big and bloody scratch that had to be taken care of. So I’d say anyone over 6ft should also avoid the place for safety. It’s a lovely and clean place to stay overnight and sleep well to then cook eggs in the morning.|LATIN|en|This place is all about location. And the host is communicative and responsive. Very close to parks and all public transport and still quiet. The “hotel quality” of linens etc is definitely not 5 star hotel.|0.0
