2026-01-15T20:24:22.426270+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|Excellent séjour! Le logement est très bien situé dans le centre de Londres à 15mn à pied du British museum et 10mn en transport de King Cross St Pancras. <br/>Le logement est un duplex avec au rez de chaussée une chambre et une salle de bain avec douche et baignoire. À l’étage un chambre avec sa salle de bain avec douche, le salon/cuisine et une petite terrasse.<br/>Willyan est très arrangeant, il m’a permis d’arriver plus tôt déposer mes bagages pour profiter pleinement de la ville.<br/>Autour du logement il y a bons nombres de commerces, de bars et de restaurants.<br/>Idéal pour passer quelques jours à Londres|3|The property is very well located in central London 15 minutes' walk from the British Museum and 10 minutes' drive from King Cross St Pancras. <br/>The property is a duplex with a room and bathroom with shower and bathtub on the ground floor. On the ground floor there is a room with bathroom with shower, living room/kitchen and a small terrace.<br/>Willyan is very tidy, he allowed me to arrive early to drop off my luggage to take full advantage of the city.<br/>Around the property there are a good number of shops, bars and restaurants.<br/> Ideal for spending days in London|LATIN|fr|The property is well-located in central London with a good number of shops, bars, and restaurants nearby.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:24:22.895332+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|Good location in terms of access to public transport into the touristy part of the city. Less so in terms of the immediate vicinity. The property cleanliness was decent. A few things like stale mouldy odour that hits you when the dishwasher was opened and the lack of clean readily usable crockery could be addressed easily before guests arrival. All so called bath towels were indeed hand towel or bath floor mat size. Apparently was advised this was to do with the laundry company supply and management couldn’t do much (?!). The place is palpably lacklustre and in desperate need of some TLC. Seems if you literally want a roof over your head with bare minimal in London then this could be it. It’s shame when a small injection of investment with some careful thought could make a substantial improvement to the experience of the guests!|5|Good location in terms of access to public transport into the touristy part of the city. Less so in terms of the immediate vicinity. The property cleanliness was decent. A few things like stale mouldy odour that hits you when the dishwasher was opened and the lack of clean readily usable crockery could be addressed easily before guests arrival. All so called bath towels were indeed hand towel or bath floor mat size. Apparently was advised this was to do with the laundry company supply and management couldn’t do much (?!). The place is palpably lacklustre and in desperate need of some TLC. Seems if you literally want a roof over your head with bare minimal in London then this could be it. It’s shame when a small injection of investment with some careful thought could make a substantial improvement to the experience of the guests!|LATIN|en|Good location in terms of access to public transport into the touristy part of the city. Less so in the immediate vicinity. Property cleanliness was decent. Lack of clean readily usable crockery could be addressed easily.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:24:23.428157+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|Steve’s place was perfect for us! The location was literally a two minute’s walk away from the tube station, making all of London easily accessible. The place was perfectly clean and Steve had left water, soda, and snacks for us. He was super easy to communicate with, always being quick to reply. He let us leave our bags after check in so that we didn’t have to carry them around London before our flight. The area seems safe and there are many shops, bakeries, and restaurants conveniently close by. Don’t miss eating at Steve’s restaurant though - he gives a guest discount and the food is amazing! We hope to be back to stay at Steve’s place, and will recommend it to all of our friends!|5|Steve’s place was perfect for us! The location was literally a two minute’s walk away from the tube station, making all of London easily accessible. The place was perfectly clean and Steve had left water, soda, and snacks for us. He was super easy to communicate with, always being quick to reply. He let us leave our bags after check in so that we didn’t have to carry them around London before our flight. The area seems safe and there are many shops, bakeries, and restaurants conveniently close by. Don’t miss eating at Steve’s restaurant though - he gives a guest discount and the food is amazing! We hope to be back to stay at Steve’s place, and will recommend it to all of our friends!|LATIN|en|Steve’s place was perfect for us! The location was literally a two minute's walk away from the tube station. The place was perfectly clean and Steve had left water, soda, and snacks for us. He was super easy to communicate with, always being quick to reply.|0.0
