r a clean, convenient, and welcoming place to stay. I can't wait to return!|LATIN|en|Guest had a great experience at this nocarz, praising its cleanliness, convenience, and responsiveness of the host.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:25:07.153489+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|The Renovated Apartment near Portobello Road Market is in a wonderful location in London.  It's in a very upscale neighborhood with all of the niceties that come with that, but also easily accessible to the things you want to see as a tourist (best of both worlds).  The apartment itself is very nice, and well cared for.  It's clean and modern.  The kitchen has the basics of what you will need including a wine cork opener.  There is a book on the back of the front door with valuable information about the apartment, its appliances, and maps of the subways.  That's a nice touch I have not had in an nocarz before.  The host, Pedro, was in touch with me before, during and after our stay.  He was able to answer questions and meet requests quickly.  There are major streets on all sides nearby with excellent restaurants and shopping.  There are also 3 train stops nearby, making it easy to get where you need to get easily.  The apartment is on the edge of Hyde Park which is so pleasant and a great way to start or end your day.  There is a washer and dryer in the apartment for clothing but also a laundromat next door if you need to do a lot of laundry!  There is also a darling cafe next door for coffee and breakfast in the morning. <br/> Very convenient.  The only thing I would want a possible renter to know is that the apartment is on the 5th floor with no elevator.   The hardest thing is carrying your luggage up the first time!   I would stay here again, we enjoyed it very much and it was a good value for the money.|5|The Renovated Apartment near Portobello Road Market is in a wonderful location in London.  It's in a very upscale neighborhood with all of the niceties that come with that, but also easily accessible to the things you want to see as a tourist (best of both worlds).  The apartment itself is very nice, and well cared for.  It's clean and modern.  The kitchen has the basics of what you will need including a wine 