2026-01-15T20:25:16.470492+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|Staying at Grant's place has caused me unnecessary stress that I hope to help future tenants to avoid. The apartment is decorated fairly nicely but if you are an animal lover beware that there are stuffed dead animals everywhere in the apartment including the bedrooms. Grant decided to have the washing machine engineer welcome us as we came in. The repair work took the engineer a while into our check in time and left an unbearable odour due to the drainage from the machine. This odour filled the entire apartment. The apartment came with one single stocking that was draped behind the bath tub. I can't imagine that was part of the furniture so must have been left by a previous tenant and the apartment obviously wasnt cleaned properly. Grant failed to leave us a key and we were not provided with a key until about 4 hours after check in. We checked out leaving the place spotless and even left a bottle of wine to say Thank You for trying. Grant decided to try and accuse us of leaving a mark on one of his side tables and tried to fine us. Fortunately we had taken photos of damage in the apartment at check in so were able to provide images with time stamps showing the damage 18 minutes into check in while his engineer was still there. He then tried to accuse us of having a party for 21 people and having been noisy almost two hours after we can prove we left the flat. Interesting how this didn't come up until his failed attempt at extorting £35 for damage we didn't cause. As Grant had no evidence to back his claims the dispute has now been resolved by air bnb. Best thing about the apartment was the location but it is still extremely over priced.|0|Staying at Grant's place has caused me unnecessary stress that I hope to help future tenants to avoid. The apartment is decorated fairly nicely but if you are an animal lover beware that there are stuffed dead animals everywhere in the apartment including the bedrooms. Grant decided to have the washing machine engineer welcome us as we came in. The repair work took the engineer a while into our check in time and left an unbearable odour due to the drainage from the machine. This odour filled the entire apartment. The apartment came with one single stocking that was draped behind the bath tub. I can't imagine that was part of the furniture so must have been left by a previous tenant and the apartment obviously wasnt cleaned properly. Grant failed to leave us a key and we were not provided with a key until about 4 hours after check in. We checked out leaving the place spotless and even left a bottle of wine to say Thank You for trying. Grant decided to try and accuse us of leaving a mark on one of his side tables and tried to fine us. Fortunately we had taken photos of damage in the apartment at check in so were able to provide images with time stamps showing the damage 18 minutes into check in while his engineer was still there. He then tried to accuse us of having a party for 21 people and having been noisy almost two hours after we can prove we left the flat. Interesting how this didn't come up until his failed attempt at extorting £35 for damage we didn't cause. As Grant had no evidence to back his claims the dispute has now been resolved by air bnb. Best thing about the apartment was the location but it is still extremely over priced.|LATIN|en|Guest had a stressful stay at Grant's place due to unhelpful communication, cleanliness issues, and uninvited guests.|0.0
