2026-01-15T20:25:25.778056+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|Great location in terms of getting around central London, close stations and lots to do around. The actual room was nice and serviceable but I had a lot of issues with the Wi-Fi and I received zero response when I enquired into it. Plus if you’re sensitive to noise then you might struggle with how thin the walls are; the conversations and music played by my neighbours were incredibly loud whenever they were in, but the streets are at least quiet when the window is shut.|4|Great location in terms of getting around central London, close stations and lots to do around. The actual room was nice and serviceable but I had a lot of issues with the Wi-Fi and I received zero response when I enquired into it. Plus if you’re sensitive to noise then you might struggle with how thin the walls are; the conversations and music played by my neighbours were incredibly loud whenever they were in, but the streets are at least quiet when the window is shut.|LATIN|en|Great location in terms of getting around central London, close stations and lots to do around. The actual room was nice and serviceable but I had a lot of issues with the Wi-Fi. Plus if you’re sensitive to noise then you might struggle with how thin the walls are.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:25:26.857659+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|Un vrai nocarz (c’est le logement principal  de Leila et ses deux enfants). On s’y sent bien. Par ailleurs, la cuisine est pratique et bien équipée. Le salon et le balcon avec une vue sur un arbre et le ciel ont été appréciés. Le logement se situe à proximité de différents commerces. Nous partions tous les jours à vélo dans le cœur de Londres via le Burgess park (et, un peu plus loin, le Rocketvan bar, un bar sympa avec une programmation musicale que l’on a apprécié après nos visites dans Londres). comptez environ 30 minutes entre le logement et le centre. Si vous revenez à vélo de Brixton, une pause à la micro brasserie supercute brewhouse s’impose également.|2|A real nocarz (this is Leila and her two children's main home). It smells good. The kitchen is convenient and well equipped. The living room and balcony with a tree view and sky were appreciated. The accommodation is close to various shops. We rode to the heart of London every day via Burgess park (and, a little further, the Rocketvan bar, a nice bar with music programming that they enjoyed after our visits to London).|LATIN|fr|A real nocarz (this is Leila and her two children's main home). It smells good. The kitchen is convenient and well equipped. The living room and balcony with a tree view and sky were appreciated.|0.0
