2026-01-15T20:25:28.069719+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|I rented the flat with my family, so 2 adults and 4 kids (from 9 to 15); for 3 nights. Instructions sent by Carlos were pretty clear to find and open the flat. This flat definitely shows value for money. It is conviently located 1 minute from a bus station with several lines, and also close to a few shops and markets to buy food for instance. The three rooms are nice, the kitchen is okay, with the necessary electrical appliances (though a bit more tableware would have been useful for 6). As we were 6, we moved some furniture to have breakfast and dinner in the same room, and it went fine. The only drawback is the noise from the road: if you're not used to sleep with noise (or with earplugs), it'll be difficult for you. That being said, the flat remains a good compromise, for the price, the location and the size. So I'd recommend.|5|I rented the flat with my family, so 2 adults and 4 kids (from 9 to 15); for 3 nights. Instructions sent by Carlos were pretty clear to find and open the flat. This flat definitely shows value for money. It is conviently located 1 minute from a bus station with several lines, and also close to a few shops and markets to buy food for instance. The three rooms are nice, the kitchen is okay, with the necessary electrical appliances (though a bit more tableware would have been useful for 6). As we were 6, we moved some furniture to have breakfast and dinner in the same room, and it went fine. The only drawback is the noise from the road: if you're not used to sleep with noise (or with earplugs), it'll be difficult for you. That being said, the flat remains a good compromise, for the price, the location and the size. So I'd recommend.|LATIN|en|Guest found the flat to be good value for money, but noted some noise from the road and some minor issues with kitchen appliances.|0.0
