2026-01-15T20:25:46.046863+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|Mark was an example what a great host should be. Our flight was delayed for 5 hours, we arrived on 00:30 at Marks place and he still waited to greet and welcome us. The unit itself is exactly what in the picture and in the description. The location, what can I say, superb!! Situated in zone 1, right across the Russel Square station, surrounded by all the shops you need (24 hours Tesco, huge supermarket, pharmacists, restaurants etc etc) you cannot ask for more. The unit sleeps 8 people easily and comfortably. The cooking utilities enough for a super chef inside us to create michelin star foods. A big thank you to Mark and big applaud for his place we cannot have enough to recommend this place to anyone who plan to visit London. Excellent!!!|5|Mark was an example what a great host should be. Our flight was delayed for 5 hours, we arrived on 00:30 at Marks place and he still waited to greet and welcome us. The unit itself is exactly what in the picture and in the description. The location, what can I say, superb!! Situated in zone 1, right across the Russel Square station, surrounded by all the shops you need (24 hours Tesco, huge supermarket, pharmacists, restaurants etc etc) you cannot ask for more. The unit sleeps 8 people easily and comfortably. The cooking utilities enough for a super chef inside us to create michelin star foods. A big thank you to Mark and big applaud for his place we cannot have enough to recommend this place to anyone who plan to visit London. Excellent!!!|LATIN|en|Mark was an example what a great host should be. The unit itself is exactly what in the picture and in the description. Situated in zone 1, right across the Russel Square station.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:25:47.107554+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|Die Zimmer sind optimal aufgeteilt für eine Familie. Ein großes Elternzimmer und ein großes Kinderzimmer. Das Bad ist mit einer Wanne ausgestattet und lädt förmlich zum Baden ein. Alles was man benötigt war vorhanden. Kühlschrank, Toaster, Wasserkocher und Mikrowelle, ausreichend Geschirr. Sogar eine gute Teeauswahl und Kaffee gab es (falls man nicht bei Susanne frühstücken möchte). Die Gastgeberfamilie ist sehr freundlich und immer für ein Gespräch zu haben. Wertvolle Tips für den Aufenthalt gibt es ausreichend. Wir werden auf jedenfall wiederkommen, da bei Susanne wohnen heißt "sich zu Hausen fühlen".|0|The rooms are ideally arranged for a family. A large parent room and a large children's room. The bathroom is equipped with a bathtub and invites you to bathe. Everything you needed was there. Refrigerator, toaster, kettle and microwave, enough dishes. There was even a good choice of tea and coffee (if you don't want to have breakfast at Susanne's). The host family is very friendly and always for conversation. Valuable tips for staying are enough. We will definitely say again, because living at Susanne's will make you feel at home.|LATIN|de|The rooms are ideally arranged for a family. A large parent room and a large children's room. The host family is very friendly and always for conversation.|0.0
