2026-01-15T20:25:48.330780+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|Our family, of six (four adults and two children), stayed at Lulu’s family home in Herne Hill for a total of ten days and it was a fantastic experience.  The house was very stylish, welcoming, and perfect for our family.  With three bedrooms on the second floor and a large master bedroom on the third floor, there was amble space for us to sleep, store our clothing and personal items.  Our boys were really thrilled with having their own kids room, equipped with bunk beds and filled with toys to play with.  The open concept living room and kitchen were spacious and perfect for day to day use.  The cozy backyard was a great place for our boys to play, and for us to BBQ and relax after busy days touring London.  Herne Hill is a great community that is surrounded by wonderful parks, shops, and easy access to all parts of London.  Lulu was very helpful answering all our questions, and provided us with excellent recommendations for places to go and things to do within Herne Hill and the surrounding area.  We would highly recommended staying here.|5|Our family, of six (four adults and two children), stayed at Lulu’s family home in Herne Hill for a total of ten days and it was a fantastic experience.  The house was very stylish, welcoming, and perfect for our family.  With three bedrooms on the second floor and a large master bedroom on the third floor, there was amble space for us to sleep, store our clothing and personal items.  Our boys were really thrilled with having their own kids room, equipped with bunk beds and filled with toys to play with.  The open concept living room and kitchen were spacious and perfect for day to day use.  The cozy backyard was a great place for our boys to play, and for us to BBQ and relax after busy days touring London.  Herne Hill is a great community that is surrounded by wonderful parks, shops, and easy access to all parts of London.  Lulu was very helpful answering all our questions, and provided us with excellent recommendations for places to go and things to do within Herne Hill and the surrounding area.  We would highly recommended staying here.|LATIN|en|Herne Hill is a great community that is surrounded by wonderful parks, shops, and easy access to all parts of London. The open concept living room and kitchen were spacious and perfect for day to day use.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:25:48.693836+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|Probably one of the best houses we have been so far. We weren’t so lucky to meet Emma in person at the check in but we were welcomed warmly by Helen and by N&J’s detailed instructions about the house. The apartment is really gorgeous and full of light. Orchids flowers and fruit on the table were waiting for us. The rooms are nice and the third bed is in a cosy small balcony overlooking the living room that our younger boy really loved. We felt at home. I had the privilege to cook in a kitchen clearly equipped for a chef preparing meals for his/her family. Transportation to the city is easy: overground and buses take you everywhere. I strongly recommend Emma’s house, even if we would keep it as our secret gem in London. Bravo!|5|Probably one of the best houses we have been so far. We weren’t so lucky to meet Emma in person at the check in but we were welcomed warmly by Helen and by N&J’s detailed instructions about the house. The apartment is really gorgeous and full of light. Orchids flowers and fruit on the table were waiting for us. The rooms are nice and the third bed is in a cosy small balcony overlooking the living room that our younger boy really loved. We felt at home. I had the privilege to cook in a kitchen clearly equipped for a chef preparing meals for his/her family. Transportation to the city is easy: overground and buses take you everywhere. I strongly recommend Emma’s house, even if we would keep it as our secret gem in London. Bravo!|LATIN|en|Guest had a wonderful stay at Emma's house, praising its cleanliness, amenities, and welcoming hosts.|0.0
