2026-01-15T20:25:49.827149+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|Our stay hasn’t been as spotless as for previous guest. <br/>While communication was smooth before booking we didn’t had any news before arrival so we first wrote an nocarz message a day before arrival that stayed unanswered and then, a couple of hours before arrival, wrote to Jessy’s phone number where she answered quickly.  <br/>The room was clean and simple but our door couldn’t be fully closed (I’m not speaking about locking it with a key - which there room doesn’t have - but closing). Neither Jessy or Harriet mentioned this beforehand or when we checked in and when we asked about it, Harriet just gave us a wedge to secure the door. <br/>Overall the house is ok, like many old London house, it doesn’t have a good thermal or noise insulation but nothing too bad. It’s clean but not spotless. Kitchen has most of the basic things you may need and bathroom is ok too.|5|Our stay hasn’t been as spotless as for previous guest. <br/>While communication was smooth before booking we didn’t had any news before arrival so we first wrote an nocarz message a day before arrival that stayed unanswered and then, a couple of hours before arrival, wrote to Jessy’s phone number where she answered quickly.  <br/>The room was clean and simple but our door couldn’t be fully closed (I’m not speaking about locking it with a key - which there room doesn’t have - but closing). Neither Jessy or Harriet mentioned this beforehand or when we checked in and when we asked about it, Harriet just gave us a wedge to secure the door. <br/>Overall the house is ok, like many old London house, it doesn’t have a good thermal or noise insulation but nothing too bad. It’s clean but not spotless. Kitchen has most of the basic things you may need and bathroom is ok too.|LATIN|en|Guest had a good stay at Jessy's place, but noted some minor issues with door closure and lack of thermal and noise insulation.|0.0
