2026-01-15T20:25:52.951268+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|Si vous cherchez une location idéalement située pour visiter Londres, ne cherchez plus, vous venez de la trouver. Ce logement a répondu à toutes nos attentes. Sa localisation est idéale, étant proche de deux gares ferroviaires à pied : Bellingham Station, qui vous amènera directement à London Bridge, ou Lower Sydenham, qui vous permet d'accéder à Victoria Station avec un seul changement. Vous pouvez même vous rendre à Londres en bus, et ils sont très fréquents. De plus, le logement est à quelques minutes à pied des commerces, ce qui est idéal pour faire des courses (Lidl se trouve à quelques mètres, Aldi ou Sainsbury's à quelques minutes à pied). Le logement est calme, propre et fonctionnel. Joan, notre hôte, a été exceptionnelle : disponible, attentionnée, bienveillante. Merci, Joan, pour votre gentillesse. Nous reviendrons.|2|If you are looking for a rental that is ideally located to visit London, stop looking, you have just found it. This property has met all our expectations. Its location is ideal, being close to two railway stations: Bellingham Station, which will take you directly to London Bridge, or Lower Sydenham, which will allow you to access Victoria Station with one change. You can even get to London by bus, and they are very frequent. Furthermore, the property is a few minutes' walk from shops, which is ideal for shopping (Lidl is a few metres' walk from Aldi or Sainsbury's). The property is quiet and clean. Our host, Joan, has been exceptionally attentive, well available. Thank you, Joan, for kindness, we will return.|LATIN|fr|Joan's property is ideally located for visiting London, quiet and clean, and the host is attentive and well-available.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:25:53.400255+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|The flat was so clean and a perfect location. Very quiet as well, which was surprising given its in-the-heart-of-the-city location. <br/>I loved that Paul offered us travel books (which I didn’t bring for our short stay).  Paul also provided many nice amenities such as electric converters (I had the wrong kind), coffee, sugar, bar soap, laundry & dishwasher soap, and paper towels/napkins. The sky lights made the apartment so well lit. The grocery was basically at the base of the building. The security to the building was very good and Paul’s instructions for entry were perfect.  Tube stations are only a few minute walk. <br/>The only things I will point out. The beds are very soft. We only stayed 2 nights so worked out but my back was a little disrupted (we prefer medium-firm beds). Also if any in your party have mobility concerns, getting in and out if the shower (in a deep soaking tub) could be harder (with a travel companion could be a help).  The lift in the bldg would be perfect for them. <br/>I highly recommend this flat for a stay in London. I certainly would return without hesitation.|5|The flat was so clean and a perfect location. Very quiet as well, which was surprising given its in-the-heart-of-the-city location. <br/>I loved that Paul offered us travel books (which I didn’t bring for our short stay).  Paul also provided many nice amenities such as electric converters (I had the wrong kind), coffee, sugar, bar soap, laundry & dishwasher soap, and paper towels/napkins. The sky lights made the apartment so well lit. The grocery was basically at the base of the building. The security to the building was very good and Paul’s instructions for entry were perfect.  Tube stations are only a few minute walk. <br/>The only things I will point out. The beds are very soft. We only stayed 2 nights so worked out but my back was a little disrupted (we prefer medium-firm beds). Also if any in your party have mobility concerns, getting in and out if the shower (in a deep soaking tub) could be harder (with a travel companion could be a help).  The lift in the bldg would be perfect for them. <br/>I highly recommend this flat for a stay in London. I certainly would return without hesitation.|LATIN|en|The flat was so clean and a perfect location. The security to the building was very good and Paul’s instructions for entry were perfect. The only things I will point out. The beds are very soft.|0.0
