2026-01-15T20:26:02.749550+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|If you’re short on cash and are used to communal living with very thin walls, a ton of rules and lecturing posts based on what you must not do, and are a heavy sleeper, this is the place for you. We stayed one night, and just left to find a hotel elsewhere. The door locks, but has a gap at bottom and window at top, so the hall light shines bright inside. The place smelled like it had been shellacked with disinfectant. The floors and bedding were clean. Any movement upstairs at all rumbled the house and we barely slept. This isn’t a “shared home” but a hostel. The owners were nice in communications, but it was not the experience we thought from reading the description.|5|If you’re short on cash and are used to communal living with very thin walls, a ton of rules and lecturing posts based on what you must not do, and are a heavy sleeper, this is the place for you. We stayed one night, and just left to find a hotel elsewhere. The door locks, but has a gap at bottom and window at top, so the hall light shines bright inside. The place smelled like it had been shellacked with disinfectant. The floors and bedding were clean. Any movement upstairs at all rumbled the house and we barely slept. This isn’t a “shared home” but a hostel. The owners were nice in communications, but it was not the experience we thought from reading the description.|LATIN|en|This isn't a "shared home" but a hostel. The owners were nice in communications, but it was not the experience we thought from reading the description. The place smelled like it had been shellacked with disinfectant.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:26:03.101501+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|Vy was a great host with clear instructions on how to find the apartment and made the check in and check out process easy. The apartment is clean and in a nice area. Some small critiques we’d have would be the lack of iron and TV as well as the door handle on the bathroom not being sturdy and falling off on our last day. The pillows were also slightly uncomfortable and the apartment is on a main road and so can get very noisy at night so you would need to keep the windows closed. It is also circa 40 minutes from central London but close to Shoreditch which is also nice. <br/>Overall, the apartment is great value for money as long as you don’t mind the travel. If some small changes could be made as mentioned above it would definitely be 5 stars.|5|Vy was a great host with clear instructions on how to find the apartment and made the check in and check out process easy. The apartment is clean and in a nice area. Some small critiques we’d have would be the lack of iron and TV as well as the door handle on the bathroom not being sturdy and falling off on our last day. The pillows were also slightly uncomfortable and the apartment is on a main road and so can get very noisy at night so you would need to keep the windows closed. It is also circa 40 minutes from central London but close to Shoreditch which is also nice. <br/>Overall, the apartment is great value for money as long as you don’t mind the travel. If some small changes could be made as mentioned above it would definitely be 5 stars.|LATIN|en|Great value for money, but some minor issues with cleanliness, amenities, and location.|0.0
