2026-01-15T20:26:10.923387+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|Nous avons passé 2 nuits dans l'appartement de Mita et notre séjour a été très agréable. Mita est très réactive et essaie d'aider ses hôtes à avoir un maximum de confort. L'appartement se trouve à 2 min à pieds du métro, le quartier est chouette, vivant mais calme, plein de petits restos. Plusieurs lignes passent à Ealing Broadway, vous arriverez donc en centre ville assez rapidement. Ligne directe jusqu'à Westminster.  L'appartement a été très propre, il a du être rénové il n'y a pas très longtemps, le linge de lit était de bonne qualité. Merci pour vos efforts Mita, nous reviendrons.|2|We spent 2 nights in Mita's apartment and our stay was very pleasant. Mita is very responsive and tries to help her guests get maximum comfort. The apartment is 2 minutes' walk from the subway, the neighborhood is nice, lively but quiet, full of small restaurants. Several lines pass through Ealing Broadway, so you will get to the city centre pretty quickly. Direct line to Westminster. The apartment was very clean, it had to be renovated not too long ago, the bed linen was of good quality. Thank you for your efforts Mita, we will come back.|LATIN|fr|Mita's apartment was pleasant, clean, and well-located, with a responsive host and good amenities.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:26:11.397116+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|We stayed in Jasmine cottage with our 3 kids 21, 18 and 15 (from the US)  The apartment was great!   Nicola emailed me in advance asking for our food preferences and stocked the fridge with eggs, cheese, bread, etc. What a delight!  The beds were comfy, towels were excellent and the robes were a great touch. We loved the location and were fortunate we had good weather and could walk most places. A great stay and London was fabulous!|5|We stayed in Jasmine cottage with our 3 kids 21, 18 and 15 (from the US)  The apartment was great!   Nicola emailed me in advance asking for our food preferences and stocked the fridge with eggs, cheese, bread, etc. What a delight!  The beds were comfy, towels were excellent and the robes were a great touch. We loved the location and were fortunate we had good weather and could walk most places. A great stay and London was fabulous!|LATIN|en|We stayed in Jasmine cottage with our 3 kids 21, 18 and 15 (from the US)  The apartment was great!   Nicola emailed me in advance asking for our food preferences and stocked the fridge with eggs, cheese, bread, etc.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:26:11.787401+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|i find this nocarz very cute , cozy and ideal for a young couple , it’s very well located close to a super market, restaurants, a little mall and its also very close to 2 overground stations and bus stops . i loved the little terrace it has that looks to the street (ideal for smokers), has all the necessary equipment , its a bit smaller from what i expected but that didn’t bother me at all, still pretty spacey for 2 tourists . What i would have liked to be different is the heater to reach warmer than just lukewarm and even tho the nocarz was quite warm itself especially during the day , there was 2 out of 4 nights that i spent there that i wished the radiator would warm a bit more but if ur someone that likes to sleep w long winter pyjamas u will be fine , the hosts were pretty helpful and kind except from the last night when we had to call cuz the code to enter the building was on my phone and my phone had gone dead , he picks up all mad talking to us like we’re not the ones who payed for the stay and whatever comes w it but him. <br/>Overall a pretty good stay but there is still room for improvement.<br/>P.S The stay was beginnings of november <br/>:D|5|i find this nocarz very cute , cozy and ideal for a young couple , it’s very well located close to a super market, restaurants, a little mall and its also very close to 2 overground stations and bus stops . i loved the little terrace it has that looks to the street (ideal for smokers), has all the necessary equipment , its a bit smaller from what i expected but that didn’t bother me at all, still pretty spacey for 2 tourists . What i would have liked to be different is the heater to reach warmer than just lukewarm and even tho the nocarz was quite warm itself especially during the day , there was 2 out of 4 nights that i spent there that i wished the radiator would warm a bit more but if ur someone that likes to sleep w long winter pyjamas u will be fine , the hosts were pretty helpful and kind except from the last night when we had to call cuz the code to enter the building was on my phone and my phone had gone dead , he picks up all mad talking to us like we’re not the ones who payed for the stay and whatever comes w it but him. <br/>Overall a pretty good stay but there is still room for improvement.<br/>P.S The stay was beginnings of november <br/>:D|LATIN|en|The nocarz was cute, cozy, and well-located, but had some minor issues with heater and radiator temperature.|0.0
