2026-01-15T20:26:13.024233+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|It was a wonderful nocarz experience. A comfortable and clean en suite in a lovely apartment with lots of artwork, plants and books, which all together give the place its character and make it feel like home. The building is a new and nice one with a good lift. Location was very good.  You can take a bus from literally in front of the building and go to Picadilly Circus directly. Tube is just minutes walk away if you prefer.<br/>Simon is a great host. Beyond that he is such a wonderful person he even gave me his spare phone after mine was stollen somewhere around Angel. And when he did this great favour, I wasn’t even staying in his place yet. I was in my previous nocarz. I will always feel thankful and lucky to discover Simon’s apartment.|5|It was a wonderful nocarz experience. A comfortable and clean en suite in a lovely apartment with lots of artwork, plants and books, which all together give the place its character and make it feel like home. The building is a new and nice one with a good lift. Location was very good.  You can take a bus from literally in front of the building and go to Picadilly Circus directly. Tube is just minutes walk away if you prefer.<br/>Simon is a great host. Beyond that he is such a wonderful person he even gave me his spare phone after mine was stollen somewhere around Angel. And when he did this great favour, I wasn’t even staying in his place yet. I was in my previous nocarz. I will always feel thankful and lucky to discover Simon’s apartment.|LATIN|en|It was a wonderful nocarz experience. A comfortable and clean en suite in a lovely apartment with lots of artwork, plants and books. The building is a new and nice one with a good lift. Location was very good.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:26:13.392288+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|Gracious welcome from Sadiq, who kindly let us leave our luggage early and helped us with our cases. Warning - there’s a few flights of typical-London-terrace steep stairs to the private quarters at the top of the house. The room was beautiful with a wonderful outlook over the garden and wider neighbourhood and the bathroom spotless and very well appointed.  Central heating and a heated towel rack added to the comfort of our stay during a cold and rainy week.<br/>The home is in a very convenient location in a great neighbourhood, two bus routes almost on the doorstep will take you right into the heart of London.<br/>The handwritten welcome card, tasty treat and luxurious toiletries were a lovely touch.  We also loved the personalised list of recommended cafes and local attractions. Thanks Sadiq!|5|Gracious welcome from Sadiq, who kindly let us leave our luggage early and helped us with our cases. Warning - there’s a few flights of typical-London-terrace steep stairs to the private quarters at the top of the house. The room was beautiful with a wonderful outlook over the garden and wider neighbourhood and the bathroom spotless and very well appointed.  Central heating and a heated towel rack added to the comfort of our stay during a cold and rainy week.<br/>The home is in a very convenient location in a great neighbourhood, two bus routes almost on the doorstep will take you right into the heart of London.<br/>The handwritten welcome card, tasty treat and luxurious toiletries were a lovely touch.  We also loved the personalised list of recommended cafes and local attractions. Thanks Sadiq!|LATIN|en|Guest had a gracious welcome from Sadiq, with a beautiful room and well-appointed private quarters in a convenient location.|0.0
