2026-01-15T20:26:14.951501+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|Llegamos temprano y pudimos entrar sin problema antes del check in. Diane es super amable y sus perritos se comportan muy bien. Todo coincidía con las fotos, la habitación es pequeña pero cómoda. La ubicación es buenísima y muy fácil llegar. Hay ascensor. Tiene a pocos pasos tiendas con todo para comprar cualquier cosa de higiene y comidas preparadas.|3|We got there early and we were able to get in without any problem before check-in. Diane is super friendly and her puppies behave very well. Everything matched the photos, the room is small but comfortable. The location is very nice and very easy to get to. There is an elevator. It's a few steps away with shops with everything to buy anything hygienic and prepared meals.|LATIN|es|Diane is super friendly and her puppies behave very well. The location is very nice and very easy to get to. There is an elevator.|0.0
