hops and local eateries a plenty.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:26:43.773700+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|We found this a nice place to stay. It was a clean and well-appointed flat with room enough for two adults and three kids, and it had almost everything we needed for our stay. The only issues we had were the fact that the sofa bed was uncomfortable and should really have had a roll-up top mattress available for use with it, and the dining chairs, although comfortable, were all scratched and very well-used, dropping vinyl flakes on the floor. Overall though, it was pretty good and we would stay here again.|5|We found this a nice place to stay. It was a clean and well-appointed flat with room enough for two adults and three kids, and it had almost everything we needed for our stay. The only issues we had were the fact that the sofa bed was uncomfortable and should really have had a roll-up top mattress available for use with it, and the dining chairs, although comfortable, were all scratched and very well-used, dropping vinyl flakes on the floor. Overall though, it was pretty good and we would stay here again.|LATIN|en|We found this a nice place to stay. It was a clean and well-appointed flat with room enough for two adults and three kids. The only issues we had were the fact that the sofa bed was uncomfortable.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:26:44.868294+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|Bon séjour chez Shane qui a répondu rapidement à nos sollicitations. L'appartement est correct pour 4 mais pas pour 5, le lit d'appoint n'est pas adapté nous avons donc dormi à 3 sur le canapé et 2 dans le lit car nous voyagions avec nos enfants. <br/>Il manque un aspirateur ou un balai pour pouvoir faire un peu de ménage au cours du séjour. <br/>Emplacement correct, 9 minutes à pieds de la gare de Willesden Junction, 1 minute pour l'arrêt de bus. Il faut compter entre 40min et 1h de trajet pour rejoindre le centre de Londres qui est bien desservi.|2|Good stay at Shane's which responded quickly to our requests. The apartment is suitable for 4 but not for 5, the extra bed is not suitable so we slept at 3 on the couch and 2 in the bed because we were traveling with our children. <br/>He lacks a vacuum cleaner or a saw to be able to clean a little house during the stay. <br/>Proper location, 9 minutes walk from Willesden Junction station, 1 minute to the bus stop. It takes between 40 minutes and 1 hour to drive to central London which is well served.|LATIN|fr|Proper location, 9 minutes walk from Willesden Junction station, 1 minute to the bus stop. It takes between 40 minutes and 1 hour to drive to central London which is well served.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:26:45.233661+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|Lovely hotel in a great location. A short walk to the tube and Hyde park and with lots of local amenities close by it made our trip so easy. <br/>The hotel is quirky and fun with so many lovely and interesting features. Although the rooms are small they provide more than enough space for a short stay. The rooms and common areas were clean and tidy and the staff couldn’t have been more accommodating. We will not hesitate to recommend to friends and family and we are looking forward to staying again soon.|5|Lovely hotel in a great location. A short walk to the tube and Hyde park and with lots of local amenities close by it made our trip so easy. <br/>The hotel is quirky and fun with so many lovely and interesting features. Although the rooms are small they provide more than enough space for a short stay. The rooms and common areas were clean and tidy and the staff couldn’t have been more accommodating. We will not hesitate to recommend to friends and family and we are looking forward to staying again soon.|LATIN|en|Lovely hotel in a great location with quirky and fun features, easy access to the tube and local amenities.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:26:45.612504+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|We had a wonderful stay in the interesting area of Peckham! If you’re like us and love exploring changing, up-and-coming neighborhoods, you will love it. The bus stops right in front of the house and we felt like we’re staying with a friend and would therefore definitely stay there again, even though there’s no Tube stop nearby.|5|We had a wonderful stay in the interesting area of Peckham! If you’re like us and love exploring changing, up-and-coming neighborhoods, you will love it. The bus stops right in front of the house and we felt like we’re staying with a friend and would therefore definitely stay there again, even though there’s no Tube stop nearby.|LATIN|en|Guest had a wonderful stay in Peckham, which is a great place to explore changing neighborhoods with easy access to public transportation.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:26:45.960323+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|I will give 5 star ⭐ to this place in term of cleaning ,location , host communication, well located and connected to center London.<br/>Everything was available at 2 mins walkable distance. <br/>My wife like the kitchen specially, everything was there and well organized.<br/> <br/>One of the best place to stay, highly recommended.<br/>Thank you Ben for all your help and assistance.|5|I will give 5 star ⭐ to this place in term of cleaning ,location , host communication, well located and connected to center London.<br/>Everything was available at 2 mins walkable distance. <br/>My wife like the kitchen specially, everything was there and well organized.<br/> <br/>One of the best place to stay, highly recommended.<br/>Thank you Ben for all your help and assistance.|LATIN|en|5-star experience with great location, cleanliness, and host communication, highly recommended.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:26:46.401806+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|Aruna is very welcoming person and easy going. He made me feel comfortable the first time we met for visiting the house and collecting the key. The apartment was immaculate, well decorated, nice very clean and cosy like in the pictures and the area is also great with all amenities close by.  I rented the flat for my parents for a week and they absolutely loved their stay and want to come back already ! And Aruna has contributed a lot for it - by staying available and prompt to our queries....so thank you so much Aruna, I highly recommend his service !|5|Aruna is very welcoming person and easy going. He made me feel comfortable the first time we met for visiting the house and collecting the key. The apartment was immaculate, well decorated, nice very clean and cosy like in the pictures and the area is also great with all amenities close by.  I rented the flat for my parents for a week and they absolutely loved their stay and want to come back already ! And Aruna has contributed a lot for it - by staying available and prompt to our queries....so thank you so much Aruna, I highly recommend his service !|LATIN|en|Aruna is very welcoming person and easy going. The apartment was immaculate, well decorated, nice very clean and cosy like in the pictures. The area is also great with all amenities close by.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:26:46.774051+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|The photos don't do Vahid's place justice. We've stayed in the area many times, and this was one of our favourite flats. Charming rooms with high ceilings and huge windows letting in lots of light, comfortable furniture, and everything you might need in the kitchen. This is also very well located, close by Old St station and to numerous bus stops, and walkable to lots of interesting areas, like Columbia Rd Market, Spitalfields and Brick Lane, the City, etc. There is a very popular (and friendly!) pub at the corner, but they bring their sidewalk tables in around 10pm every evening, so the noise is contained and didn't affect our sleep. Vahid was a welcoming, friendly, and responsive host, and we appreciated his warmth and flexibility throughout our stay.|5|The photos don't do Vahid's place justice. We've stayed in the area many times, and this was one of our favourite flats. Charming rooms with high ceilings and huge windows letting in lots of light, comfortable furniture, and everything you might need in the kitchen. This is also very well located, close by Old St station and to numerous bus stops, and walkable to lots of interesting areas, like Columbia Rd Market, Spitalfields and Brick Lane, the City, etc. There is a very popular (and friendly!) pub at the corner, but they bring their sidewalk tables in around 10pm every evening, so the noise is contained and didn't affect our sleep. Vahid was a welcoming, friendly, and responsive host, and we appreciated his warmth and flexibility throughout our stay.|LATIN|en|Guest loved Vahid's place, which was charming, well-located, and had a welcoming host.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:26:47.163149+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|One of those rare gems at Notting Hill run by REAL hosts, not an Agency! Highly recommended! About 4,5m high ceilings and enourmous windows, one of which giving to a communal garden... Very clean & perfectly located. Jodie is an adorable host - very attentive and helpful. I'd love to return there again!|5|One of those rare gems at Notting Hill run by REAL hosts, not an Agency! Highly recommended! About 4,5m high ceilings and enourmous windows, one of which giving to a communal garden... Very clean & perfectly located. Jodie is an adorable host - very attentive and helpful. I'd love to return there again!|LATIN|en|Jodie is an adorable host - very attentive and helpful. About 4,5m high ceilings and enourmous windows.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:26:47.634173+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|A very pretty house situated in a quiet cul-de-sac in Chelsea.<br/>The hub of the house is a large bright, airy kitchen with a small terrace.<br/>The house is full of the family’s personal effects which suited me as I had chosen this house partly because of the fact it wasn’t a house that stood empty much of the time. I had wanted a house with some character.<br/>The beds are extremely comfortable and the rooms are quiet.<br/>On the first floor there is a further terrace, much larger than the ground floor. With a table for four.<br/>The house does sleep six people but would better suit four in terms of living accommodation.<br/>The hostess, Sophie, was responsive and accommodating  both through the booking process and during my stay.<br/>Overall a very lovely stay in a clean, well located (just off the Kings Road) house that is bursting with charm.|5|A very pretty house situated in a quiet cul-de-sac in Chelsea.<br/>The hub of the house is a large bright, airy kitchen with a small terrace.<br/>The house is full of the family’s personal effects which suited me as I had chosen this house partly because of the fact it wasn’t a house that stood empty much of the time. I had wanted a house with some character.<br/>The beds are extremely comfortable and the rooms are quiet.<br/>On the first floor there is a further terrace, much larger than the ground floor. With a table for four.<br/>The house does sleep six people but would better suit four in terms of living accommodation.<br/>The hostess, Sophie, was responsive and accommodating  both through the booking process and during my stay.<br/>Overall a very lovely stay in a clean, well located (just off the Kings Road) house that is bursting with charm.|LATIN|en|A very pretty house situated in a quiet cul-de-sac in Chelsea. The hub of the house is a large bright, airy kitchen with a small terrace. The beds are extremely comfortable and the rooms are quiet.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:26:48.769215+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|Très bel appartement dans l'ancienne ambassade de la Norvège sur Trafalgar Square , en plein centre de Londres , à deux pas de Soho et Chinatown . Très pratique pour manger sans se ruiner le soir . On peut faire énormément de choses à pied à partir de là . <br/>La chambre est très confortable , avec un petit coin salon permettant de prendre son petit déjeuner ou son repas .<br/>La chambre est plutôt calme , à part les importants travaux en cours qui démarrent à 07H30 le matin .<br/>La cuisine est très fonctionnelle et la salle d'eau individuelle est très bien . <br/>Nous n'avons pas été dérangé par les autres locataires car l'isolation entre les chambres est très bonne .|1|Very nice apartment in the former Norwegian Embassy on Trafalgar Square in central London, a stone's throw from Soho and Chinatown. Very convenient to eat without ruining the evening. A lot of things can be done on foot from there. <br/>The room is very comfortable, with a small living room corner to take your breakfast or dinner. <br/>The room is rather quiet, except for the important individual work in progress that starts at 07:30 in the morning. <br/>The kitchen is very functional and the bathroom is very good. <br/>We were not disturbed by the other tenants because the isolation between the rooms is very good.|LATIN|fr|Very nice apartment in central London with comfortable room, functional kitchen, and good isolation from other tenants.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:26:49.118033+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|My mother and I stayed here for our 12 day trip to London. The apartment was lovely. Had everything we needed. Close to stores and transportation. Being so close to the Bakerloo line made it very easy for transfers to trains for our day trips out of town. The outdoor space was lovely, to enjoy the wonderful weather we had, after a long day of sightseeing. Patrick was a very attentive host, very quick to respond to any questions or concerns.   I very highly recommended this little apartment.|5|My mother and I stayed here for our 12 day trip to London. The apartment was lovely. Had everything we needed. Close to stores and transportation. Being so close to the Bakerloo line made it very easy for transfers to trains for our day trips out of town. The outdoor space was lovely, to enjoy the wonderful weather we had, after a long day of sightseeing. Patrick was a very attentive host, very quick to respond to any questions or concerns.   I very highly recommended this little apartment.|LATIN|en|Lovely apartment with great location, attentive host, and easy access to transportation and amenities.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:26:49.495684+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|What a delightful place. 🌟 🌟 🌟 🌟 🌟 <br/>Michelle was there to warmly welcome us despite the delay we experienced at Heathrow. The apartment was clean, and exactly as described in the advert. She even left toiletries and even food stuff for our use. <br/>The apartment is situated in a good area with easy access to Algate East Station, shops, restaurants, and pubs. It was worth every pence and more. <br/>My wife and I enjoyed every minute of our stay in the apartment and will go back again and again.<br/>Highly recommended!!!!|5|What a delightful place. 🌟 🌟 🌟 🌟 🌟 <br/>Michelle was there to warmly welcome us despite the delay we experienced at Heathrow. The apartment was clean, and exactly as described in the advert. She even left toiletries and even food stuff for our use. <br/>The apartment is situated in a good area with easy access to Algate East Station, shops, restaurants, and pubs. It was worth every pence and more. <br/>My wife and I enjoyed every minute of our stay in the apartment and will go back again and again.<br/>Highly recommended!!!!|LATIN|en|Guest had a delightful stay at Michelle's apartment, which was clean, well-located, and exactly as described.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:26:49.914319+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|Salwa could not meet us because of a family emergency but was in regular communication with me in the run up to my stay and arranged for her friend to meet us instead. Salwa also checked in with me during the stay to make sure all was well (sorry - I didn't see it until afterwards but thank you!) Our room and the communal spaces (kitchen and bathroom) were very clean, location is great - especially if you want somewhere close to Paddington but a bit quieter, that said - good pubs within easy reach. Just because we were surprised by it - will highlight that the flat has three bedrooms available so there may be other guests there during your stay and there is no living room.|5|Salwa could not meet us because of a family emergency but was in regular communication with me in the run up to my stay and arranged for her friend to meet us instead. Salwa also checked in with me during the stay to make sure all was well (sorry - I didn't see it until afterwards but thank you!) Our room and the communal spaces (kitchen and bathroom) were very clean, location is great - especially if you want somewhere close to Paddington but a bit quieter, that said - good pubs within easy reach. Just because we were surprised by it - will highlight that the flat has three bedrooms available so there may be other guests there during your stay and there is no living room.|LATIN|en|Salwa's flat was clean, quiet, and well-located, with good pubs nearby, but note that it has three bedrooms and no living room.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:26:50.260300+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|Great place to stay at central london, the location is the best you will get for the price. <br/>The entrance can be difficult if you have a lot of luggage, but nothing impossible, the room it’s definitely small but it has everything you might need, and its way better than in the pictures.<br/>Just keep in mind this is a busy area and there are a lot of noises at night, we brought our own earplugs and had a good night sleep|5|Great place to stay at central london, the location is the best you will get for the price. <br/>The entrance can be difficult if you have a lot of luggage, but nothing impossible, the room it’s definitely small but it has everything you might need, and its way better than in the pictures.<br/>Just keep in mind this is a busy area and there are a lot of noises at night, we brought our own earplugs and had a good night sleep|LATIN|en|Great value for the price, but be aware of noise from the busy area and small room.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:26:50.636089+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|This home is designed beautifully and functioned very well for our family of 5! We felt right at home, and the children enjoyed the garden on the dry days. Although, it’s a little farther outside the city, the location gives you a sense of everyday life as a Londoner :) I wouldn’t recommend this home to anyone looking for a wonderfully curated home with lots of space!|5|This home is designed beautifully and functioned very well for our family of 5! We felt right at home, and the children enjoyed the garden on the dry days. Although, it’s a little farther outside the city, the location gives you a sense of everyday life as a Londoner :) I wouldn’t recommend this home to anyone looking for a wonderfully curated home with lots of space!|LATIN|en|This home is beautifully designed and functioned well for our family of 5, with a lovely garden and great location.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:26:51.014754+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|Rosie and Stuart are incredibly nice people. They are flexible and make sure you make the most of your time in London. The house was very clean, comfortable and at the same time “homely”. Muswell Hill is a really nice area too. We would love to stay with Rosie and Stuart again when we have to opportunity!|5|Rosie and Stuart are incredibly nice people. They are flexible and make sure you make the most of your time in London. The house was very clean, comfortable and at the same time “homely”. Muswell Hill is a really nice area too. We would love to stay with Rosie and Stuart again when we have to opportunity!|LATIN|en|Rosie and Stuart's house was very clean, comfortable, and homely, with a great location in Muswell Hill.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:26:51.548539+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|Eleonor's house is exactly like the pictures on nocarz, very clean, quiet, comfy and tidy.  <br/>We  met eleonor a few times during the stay, she is super friendly and replies really quickly. She gave us a very detail house manual, showing how to use tv, and everything which is really nice.<br/>I think the best thing of this house is that there is a lift in the building (which is quite rare in london) and the house locates very close to the earl's court station (which also has lifts too) . It has easy access to all london attractions and the airport. I will definitely suggest eleonor's house, if you are travelling with parents like me, or doesnt want to carry luggage upstairs.<br/>Thank you very much for giving us an amazing stay Eleonor :) xx|5|Eleonor's house is exactly like the pictures on nocarz, very clean, quiet, comfy and tidy.  <br/>We  met eleonor a few times during the stay, she is super friendly and replies really quickly. She gave us a very detail house manual, showing how to use tv, and everything which is really nice.<br/>I think the best thing of this house is that there is a lift in the building (which is quite rare in london) and the house locates very close to the earl's court station (which also has lifts too) . It has easy access to all london attractions and the airport. I will definitely suggest eleonor's house, if you are travelling with parents like me, or doesnt want to carry luggage upstairs.<br/>Thank you very much for giving us an amazing stay Eleonor :) xx|LATIN|en|Eleonor's house is exactly like the pictures on nocarz, very clean, quiet, comfy and tidy. The house locates very close to the earl's court station (which also has lifts too) It has easy access to all london attractions and the airport.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:26:51.928732+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|This was a perfect place to stay for us. The location is great with short walking distance to two tube lines giving easy access around London. We were able to easily get to central London, the Olympic park, and the airport. The pub next door was a fantastic way to end off an evening with great local brews as well. Would highly recommend this place for a stay in North London.|5|This was a perfect place to stay for us. The location is great with short walking distance to two tube lines giving easy access around London. We were able to easily get to central London, the Olympic park, and the airport. The pub next door was a fantastic way to end off an evening with great local brews as well. Would highly recommend this place for a stay in North London.|LATIN|en|Perfect place to stay in North London with great location, easy access to central London, Olympic park, and airport.|0.0
2026-01-15T20:26:52.288127+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|My family and I absolutely loved Mary's space. It was exactly what we needed and more. It was exceptionally clean and absolutely beautiful in every way. Mary's attention to all the little details and helpful directions made for a very easy adjustment to a new city. <br/>Whenever we had a question for Mary she would respond very quickly whether it was before our arrival at Mary's house or during our stay. Public transportation such as bus stations and tube stations were walking distance away and could get you into the city in about 30 minutes. It was a lovely quiet space to come back to after a long day exploring.|5|My family and I absolutely loved Mary's space. It was exactly what we needed and more. It was exceptionally clean and absolutely beautiful in every way. Mary's attention to all the little details and helpful directions made for a very easy adjustment to a new city. <br/>Whenever we had a question for Mary she would respond very quickly whether it was before our arrival at Mary's house or during our stay. Public transportation such as bus stations and tube stations were walking distance away and could get you into the city in about 30 minutes. It was a lovely quiet space to come back to after a long day exploring.|LATIN|en|Mary's space was exactly what we needed, clean, beautiful, and quiet, with excellent public transportation links.|0.0
