2026-01-15T20:26:53.100613+0000 INFO [user]:[complex]|Lovely 3bd, 2 ba apartment just outside of the chaos of central London, but close to the underground (Warwick/Bakerloo Line) and bus stop to make it easy to get into London.  The apartment area is in nice, safe and walkable area with a small Tesco and other bodegas close-by and many restaurants.  You can take one of the Little Venice  canal boats to Camden and then walk to the London Zoo/Regents Park.  If you want, you can even walk to Paddington Station which is about 1/2 mile away.  <br/>The apartment has all of the amenities you need including a dishwasher and a separate washer and dryer.  There is a nice private park in the center of the complex that has a nice play area for children 10 and under.|5|Lovely 3bd, 2 ba apartment just outside of the chaos of central London, but close to the underground (Warwick/Bakerloo Line) and bus stop to make it easy to get into London.  The apartment area is in nice, safe and walkable area with a small Tesco and other bodegas close-by and many restaurants.  You can take one of the Little Venice  canal boats to Camden and then walk to the London Zoo/Regents Park.  If you want, you can even walk to Paddington Station which is about 1/2 mile away.  <br/>The apartment has all of the amenities you need including a dishwasher and a separate washer and dryer.  There is a nice private park in the center of the complex that has a nice play area for children 10 and under.|LATIN|en|Lovely apartment in a safe and walkable area with easy access to public transportation and amenities.|0.0
