dern and nice residence. But still even the flat would offered by a third price, would not recommend you to rent because staying there is too bad for your health so never!!! No human being should stay there..|LATIN|en|The flat is half basement. Since it is basement, there is constant mold and humid problem in the flat. As soon as you enter the flat you feel it so intensely. Although we booked the flat for a month we had to terminate on the 3rd night as started to feel unhealthy.|0.0
