2026-01-15T20:27:11.547247+0000 INFO [user]:[base]|We had a great experience at the fox den! Everything was clean and nicely decorated, we felt very at home. We loved the little balcony and the amazing views you could get over canary wharf. We had everything we needed for our weekend trip and the host Sinnead was very friendly and gave us a warm welcome and showed us around the apartment. The area is very quiet which was nice to get a well rested sleep and relax in the evening from walking around the city all day. The flat is only 10mins away from a tube station which makes getting around London very easy. For us it was also very easy to travel from the Mile End station to the airport as there is a great straight bus connection. <br/>Thank you to our great host! We had an amazing weekend!|5|We had a great experience at the fox den! Everything was clean and nicely decorated, we felt very at home. We loved the little balcony and the amazing views you could get over canary wharf. We had everything we needed for our weekend trip and the host Sinnead was very friendly and gave us a warm welcome and showed us around the apartment. The area is very quiet which was nice to get a well rested sleep and relax in the evening from walking around the city all day. The flat is only 10mins away from a tube station which makes getting around London very easy. For us it was also very easy to travel from the Mile End station to the airport as there is a great straight bus connection. <br/>Thank you to our great host! We had an amazing weekend!|LATIN|en|We had a great experience at the fox den! Everything was clean and nicely decorated, we felt very at home. We loved the little balcony and the amazing views you could get over canary wharf.|0.0
